--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party and bundled content
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

The skill library bundled with this project — under `skills/public/`,
`skills/local/`, `meta_skills/`, and `runtime/execution/.../all_skills/`
— contains agent "skill" definitions (SKILL.md prompt/instruction files
and their helper scripts). Some of these are authored within this
project; others are, or are adapted from, external or community sources.

Per-skill provenance is not yet recorded uniformly. This NOTICE does not
assert original authorship of every bundled skill. Contributors adding or
updating a skill should record its origin and license in the SKILL.md
front matter (for example `source:`, `license:`, and `author:` fields) so
that this NOTICE can be made precise over time. See CONTRIBUTING.md.

If you believe any bundled content is misattributed, omits a required
upstream notice, or is incompatible with redistribution under Apache-2.0,
please open an issue so it can be corrected or removed.

Python and JavaScript dependencies are distributed under their own
licenses; see the lockfiles (`uv.lock`, `frontend/pnpm-lock.yaml`) for the
authoritative dependency set.


